  "resource": {
    "body": "<div>\n            \n  <div class=\"section\">\n\n<p>If you encounter any issues in using Zotonic, or have ideas for new features,\nplease let us know at the <a class=\"reference external\" href=\"https://github.com/zotonic/zotonic/issues\">Zotonic issue tracker</a>. You need to have a free\nGitHub account to do so.</p>\n<p>Before submitting a new issue, please search the issues list to see if the issue\nbug has already been reported.</p>\n<p>Every first Monday of the month a new version of Zotonic is <a class=\"reference internal\" href=\"/id/doc_developerguide_contributing#releases\"><span class=\"std std-ref\">released</span></a>.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n           </div>",
